# Secrets live in .env.local (gitignored):
#   CONVEX_DEPLOY_KEY   — Convex deploy key (braindot project)
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_CONVEX_URL — deployment URL the frontend talks to
#   OPENAI_API_KEY      — OpenAI key for /api/ai/ask (Writer AI + Ask AI)
#   OPENAI_MODEL        — optional, defaults to gpt-4o-mini
#
# These live on the Convex deployment, not here — set with
# `npx convex env set NAME value`:
#   AUTH_RESEND_KEY     — Resend key for password-reset codes. Unset, the
#                         code goes to `npx convex logs` instead of an inbox.
#   AUTH_EMAIL_FROM     — optional sender, e.g. "braindot <no-reply@...>"
#   SITE_URL            — required by every Convex Auth code flow
#   RATE_LIMIT_SECRET   — the same value as the one on the web server
